						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#387">Important</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							In case u guys didnt know, i am a reservist with the US Navy.  Our unit is on standby for deployment and will know i hope by next weekend.  If i end up getting deployed i may be gone for a year.  So if this happens i need to make sure my officers take responsiblity and see to it that we are kept going.  I need to nominate a raid officer and master-at-arms.<br />
I also need to nominate a party planner for skills parties and booze-outs.  If anyone interested send me an email at seabez@aol.com.  Please recruit responsible members whenever I am not on, we have to constantly build good people of all lvls so we can help each other quest and raid.  Thanks.  Please make sure our members that havent registered do so as soon as possible so we can see who we have and let people view the site who may want to join us.  All is appreciated.  Thanks again.
