					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							I am currently waiting to hold a meeting with the leader of the Emerald Kin.  This is an elite clan, whom it's members are ONLY of Elven race.  This clan has many members that are not in the guild due to their race, and may possibly be joining ours, (the non-elven).  I encourage the officers if they see and of the emerald kin running around to introduce yourself to them and tell them the plan.  It has not been official as of yet, but are welcome to join anytime.  We are not over taking their guild, just giving their alts a home.  This is a great opportunity to grow and prosper and become one of the best.  Keep in mind we are still short handed, and it is the duties of the officers to recruit good people.  Keep up the good work all!  Hope to seee you soon.  Don't forget the to remind the others they need to register here so they can view the news and leave messages.
